{
  "story": {
    "intro": "Founded in 1999 by Jeff Payne, Eleven is a boutique audio post-production studio in West Los Angeles. Its work covers mix, sound design, voiceover, ADR, music and voice casting. The name is a nod to Spinal Tap, the studio that goes one louder.",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "text": "In 2022, after 24 years in Santa Monica, Jeff and partner Jordan Meltzer bought a building in West LA and built three new studios from scratch.¹AJ Murillo has since joined them as a partner.",
        "note": { "n": "01", "text": " The original plan was America’s largest Hot Dog-On-A-Stick franchise. Legal squabbles killed the dream, so we settled for three primo studios." },
        "width": 1147
      },
      {
        "text": "More than 100 brands work with Eleven, including Nike, Apple, Adidas, Uber Eats, Lexus and Verizon.¹¹ We take sound very seriously. Everything else, we’re still working on.",
        "note": { "n": "02", "text": "Yes, we know. Bragging. Marketing made us put it here." },
        "width": 922
      }
    ],
